        <mxCell id="leg-t1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#E6EAF0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Publish (Lambda)&lt;/b&gt; – re-checks every file’s hash, copies the release to the private S3 origin, then moves the pointer: HI-Large runs go to the main dashboard, every other run to the demo page (?view=demo). A repeat of an already-published input is re-checked and shown the same way. Unlocks the pipeline; CloudFront serves it to viewers." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="1482" x="78" y="770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg-t2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#E6EAF0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;On failure&lt;/b&gt; – a Lambda records the error, SNS emails the team, the run stops. Paid jobs are never retried automatically." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="1482" x="78" y="810" as="geometry" />
